{
  "category": "resources",
  "title": "When You Feel Stuck in a Life Transition",
  "slug": "when-you-feel-stuck-in-a-life-transition",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "draft": false,
  "excerpt": "When old patterns no longer fit and new ones are not yet clear, a few questions can help you slow down and notice what is actually changing.",
  "body": {
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Transitions can feel confusing because old patterns no longer fit, but new ones are not yet clear."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In these moments, it may help to slow down and ask:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What is actually changing in my life right now?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What feels uncertain — and what is still stable?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What expectations am I holding that no longer match reality?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What would it look like to give myself more time?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stuckness is often not a lack of direction, but a process of adjustment."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
